{
  "id": "u02",
  "n": 2,
  "level": "A1",
  "title": "Gender, articles, plurals",
  "summary": "el or la, one or many, and adjectives that agree.",
  "explain": [
    {"h": "Every noun is masculine or feminine"},
    {"p": "Most nouns ending in **-o** are masculine, most ending in **-a** are feminine. Learn each noun *with its article*: that's why the word lists show *el* and *la*."},
    {"table": [["", "masculine", "feminine"], ["the (one)", "el", "la"], ["the (many)", "los", "las"], ["a / some", "un / unos", "una / unas"]], "head": true},
    {"ex": ["el coche, la casa", "the car, the house"]},
    {"ex": ["un presupuesto, una factura", "a quote, an invoice"]},
    {"p": "Common exceptions: **el problema, el día, el mapa, el sistema** (masculine) and **la mano, la foto, la radio** (feminine). Nouns in **-ción** and **-dad** are feminine: *la instalación, la ciudad*."},
    {"tip": "Feminine nouns starting with a stressed *a-* take *el* in the singular to sound better, but stay feminine: *el agua fría*, *las aguas*."},
    {"h": "Plurals"},
    {"p": "Ending in a vowel → add **-s**: *la ventana → las ventanas*. Ending in a consonant → add **-es**: *el camión → los camiones*, *la pared → las paredes*. A final **-z** becomes **-ces**: *la vez → las veces*."},
    {"h": "Adjectives agree"},
    {"p": "Adjectives usually come **after** the noun and match it in gender and number."},
    {"table": [["", "singular", "plural"], ["masculine", "el marco nuevo", "los marcos nuevos"], ["feminine", "la ventana nueva", "las ventanas nuevas"]], "head": true},
    {"p": "Adjectives ending in **-e** or a consonant don't change for gender: *un cliente importante, una reunión importante*; plural *importantes, difíciles*."}
  ],
  "exercises": [
    {"type": "choice", "q": "___ ventana", "options": ["el", "la"], "a": 1, "tags": ["article-gender"]},
    {"type": "choice", "q": "___ problema", "options": ["el", "la"], "a": 0, "why": "Problema is masculine, an exception.", "tags": ["article-exception"]},
    {"type": "choice", "q": "___ instalación", "options": ["el", "la"], "a": 1, "why": "-ción nouns are feminine.", "tags": ["article-gender"]},
    {"type": "choice", "q": "___ día", "options": ["el", "la"], "a": 0, "why": "Día is masculine, an exception.", "tags": ["article-exception"]},
    {"type": "choice", "q": "___ mano", "options": ["el", "la"], "a": 1, "why": "Mano is feminine, an exception.", "tags": ["article-exception"]},
    {"type": "choice", "q": "Necesito ___ tornillos.", "options": ["unos", "unas"], "a": 0, "tags": ["article-indef"]},
    {"type": "choice", "q": "Es una casa ___.", "options": ["pequeño", "pequeña"], "a": 1, "tags": ["adj-agreement"]},
    {"type": "choice", "q": "Los clientes están ___.", "options": ["contento", "contentos"], "a": 1, "tags": ["adj-agreement"]},
    {"type": "gap", "q": "___ ciudad es muy grande.", "hint": "the", "a": "la", "en": "The city is very big.", "tags": ["article-gender"]},
    {"type": "gap", "q": "___ marcos son de aluminio.", "hint": "the", "a": "los", "en": "The frames are aluminium.", "tags": ["article-plural"]},
    {"type": "gap", "q": "Tengo ___ pregunta.", "hint": "a", "a": "una", "en": "I have a question.", "tags": ["article-indef"]},
    {"type": "gap", "q": "Es ___ edificio antiguo.", "hint": "a", "a": "un", "en": "It's an old building.", "tags": ["article-indef"]},
    {"type": "transform", "instr": "Make it plural.", "q": "la pared", "a": "las paredes", "tags": ["plural-consonant"]},
    {"type": "transform", "instr": "Make it plural.", "q": "el camión", "a": "los camiones", "tags": ["plural-consonant"]},
    {"type": "transform", "instr": "Make it plural.", "q": "la ventana nueva", "a": "las ventanas nuevas", "tags": ["plural-vowel", "adj-agreement"]},
    {"type": "transform", "instr": "Make it plural.", "q": "un cliente importante", "a": "unos clientes importantes", "tags": ["plural-vowel", "article-indef"]},
    {"type": "transform", "instr": "Make it plural.", "q": "la vez", "a": "las veces", "tags": ["plural-z"]},
    {"type": "transform", "instr": "Make it feminine.", "q": "el amigo simpático", "a": "la amiga simpática", "tags": ["adj-agreement"]},
    {"type": "error", "q": "La problema es grande.", "a": "El problema es grande.", "why": "Problema is masculine.", "tags": ["article-exception"]},
    {"type": "error", "q": "Las ventanas son nuevos.", "a": "Las ventanas son nuevas.", "why": "Ventanas is feminine plural, so nuevas.", "tags": ["adj-agreement"]},
    {"type": "error", "q": "Tengo dos coche.", "a": "Tengo dos coches.", "why": "Two of something → plural.", "tags": ["plural-vowel"]},
    {"type": "translate", "q": "the new windows", "a": "las ventanas nuevas / las nuevas ventanas", "tags": ["adj-agreement", "article-plural"]},
    {"type": "translate", "q": "a big company", "a": "una empresa grande / una gran empresa", "tags": ["adj-agreement", "article-indef"]},
    {"type": "reorder", "words": ["Las", "paredes", "son", "blancas"], "a": "Las paredes son blancas", "en": "The walls are white.", "tags": ["adj-agreement"]},
    {"type": "match", "instr": "Match the noun to its article.", "pairs": [["agua", "el"], ["ciudad", "la"], ["mapa", "el"], ["foto", "la"], ["sistema", "el"]], "tags": ["article-exception"]}
  ]
}
